// # Turning Proof-of-Concept Research into Full Blown Applications!
//
// ### A post-retirement Project
//
// **Jan Martin Jansen** · November 2026
//
// *An interactive presentation powered by Sapl & the JMVM. Running entirely in the browser (WebAssembly).*
//
// *(Navigation: **Space** / **PageDown** / **→** next slide · **PageUp** / **←** previous · **C** toggle code · **F** fullscreen · **Esc** to notebook view, **P** back to slides)*
